WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:07.417
When we last saw Edward, he had just arrived on Offal Street.

2
00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:14.439
"Help! Help!" Edward cried as Tom's father, John Canty, dragged him home.

3
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:18.488
A few people followed them.

4
00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:23.430
"Are you all right?" a man in black called out to Edward.

5
00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:28.281
"No, I am not all right!" Edward said indignantly.

6
00:00:28.282 --> 00:00:36.529
"I am Prince Edward, and this stranger has kidnapped me!"

7
00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:42.568
"Be quiet, you miserable boy!" John threatened Edward with a stick.

8
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:47.578
Suddenly the man in black reached out to snatch Edward away from John.

9
00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:55.267
"Stop interfering!" John struck the man, who fell to the ground.

10
00:00:55.268 --> 00:01:01.758
Without looking back, John dragged Edward into a house.

11
00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:08.230
They climbed the stairs and John pushed Edward into a smelly, crowded room.

12
00:01:08.231 --> 00:01:16.628
Tom's mother was cooking over a fire in the fireplace, while his sister, Nancy, hung laundry nearby.

13
00:01:16.629 --> 00:01:21.206
"I found Tom wandering the streets," John said.

14
00:01:21.207 --> 00:01:27.740
"I told you before that I'm not Tom!" Edward stamped his foot.

15
00:01:27.741 --> 00:01:30.210
"I'm Prince Edward.

16
00:01:30.211 --> 00:01:37.778
Take me back to the palace gate, and my father, the king, will send Tom out to you."

17
00:01:37.779 --> 00:01:40.785
"Oh, my poor boy!"

18
00:01:40.786 --> 00:01:46.583
Tom's mother put her hands on Edward's shoulders and studied his face.

19
00:01:46.584 --> 00:01:51.131
"All your reading about royalty has made you think you're a prince.

20
00:01:51.132 --> 00:01:58.054
But that's not true. Can't you see that I'm your mother?"

21
00:01:58.055 --> 00:02:04.494
Edward shrugged off her hands. "I've never seen you before in my life."

22
00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:13.887
Tom's mother began to cry. "Oh, Tom, what's wrong with you?"

23
00:02:13.888 --> 00:02:22.179
John laughed and ordered Nancy to curtsy to the prince.

24
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:28.276
"Father, please stop teasing Tom and let him go to bed," Nancy said.

25
00:02:28.277 --> 00:02:30.926
"He'll be better in the morning."

26
00:02:30.927 --> 00:02:37.787
"Speaking of the morning . . ." John turned to Edward and held out his hand.

27
00:02:37.788 --> 00:02:44.942
"The rent's due tomorrow. Hand over what you earned begging today."

28
00:02:44.943 --> 00:02:48.317
"Begging? Princes don't beg!"

29
00:02:48.318 --> 00:02:53.630
Edward was insulted that John was bothering him about money.

30
00:02:53.631 --> 00:02:59.868
John growled. "Go to bed before I lose my temper and hit you!"

31
00:02:59.869 --> 00:03:03.872
Edward looked around the room but didn't see any beds.

32
00:03:03.873 --> 00:03:07.449
"Where am I supposed to sleep?"

33
00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:12.378
"Over there in that corner as usual," Nancy said quietly.

34
00:03:12.379 --> 00:03:17.590
She pointed to a pile of old blankets and straw.

35
00:03:17.591 --> 00:03:21.455
Edward was too tired to protest.

36
00:03:21.456 --> 00:03:27.747
He went over and lay down on the floor.

37
00:03:27.748 --> 00:03:34.407
*** Later, when everyone was asleep, Tom's mother tiptoed over to

38
00:03:34.408 --> 00:03:39.475
Edward. "I saved you some bread crusts," she said.

39
00:03:39.476 --> 00:03:44.473
Edward sat up and took a bite of stale bread.

40
00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:51.414
"Thank you, good woman. The king will reward your kindness."

41
00:03:51.415 --> 00:03:57.839
Tom's mother shook her head sadly and went back to her bed.

42
00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:02.434
"Something's not quite right," she thought.

43
00:04:02.435 --> 00:04:09.277
"Maybe this boy isn't Tom. Oh, but that's absurd."

44
00:04:09.278 --> 00:04:18.769
She tried to sleep but kept thinking, "If only there was some way to test him—"

45
00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:24.043
Suddenly Edward made a sound in his sleep as if he'd been startled.

46
00:04:24.044 --> 00:04:27.613
"That's it!" Tom's mother said softly.

47
00:04:27.614 --> 00:04:33.647
"Tom always makes an odd gesture whenever he's startled, even in his sleep.

48
00:04:33.648 --> 00:04:39.299
He covers his eyes with his palm out."

49
00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:45.151
She crept to Edward's side with a candle and struck the floor with her fist.

50
00:04:45.152 --> 00:04:50.976
His eyes flew open, but he didn't make the gesture.

51
00:04:50.977 --> 00:04:54.757
She tried twice more with the same result.

52
00:04:54.758 --> 00:05:01.466
"I don't understand. He's made that gesture his whole life."

53
00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:05.554
Tom's mother sadly crept away.

54
00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:12.725
"Something is wrong with my boy, but I won't give up on him."

55
00:05:12.726 --> 00:05:19.865
Around midnight everyone was awakened by a knock at the door.

56
00:05:19.866 --> 00:05:23.053
Tom's father stopped snoring.

57
00:05:23.054 --> 00:05:28.173
"Who's there?" he shouted. "What do you want?"

58
00:05:28.174 --> 00:05:32.117
"I came to warn you," said a voice outside the door.

59
00:05:32.118 --> 00:05:35.972
"That man you hit with your stick was Father Andrew.

60
00:05:35.973 --> 00:05:40.737
He's badly injured, and you're going to be arrested."

61
00:05:40.738 --> 00:05:45.394
"Get up! We have to leave right now!" John shouted to his family.

62
00:05:45.395 --> 00:05:53.814
Five minutes later the Cantys and Edward were flying down the stairs.

63
00:05:53.815 --> 00:05:58.209
They moved quickly through the dark streets.

64
00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:03.160
As they neared the bridge, they heard people cheering the prince and the mayor.

65
00:06:03.161 --> 00:06:09.047
"I'm supposed to be at the mayor's banquet!" Edward suddenly remembered.

66
00:06:09.048 --> 00:06:14.641
A line of bonfires stretched up and down both sides of the river.

67
00:06:14.642 --> 00:06:20.985
Periodically there was a great booming sound as fireworks filled the sky.

68
00:06:20.986 --> 00:06:24.543
People danced and sang in the streets.

69
00:06:24.544 --> 00:06:29.444
The Cantys and Edward joined the crowd.

70
00:06:29.445 --> 00:06:34.294
"If we get separated, we'll meet on the bridge," John shouted to his family.

71
00:06:34.295 --> 00:06:37.072
But Edward had other plans.

72
00:06:37.073 --> 00:06:42.332
From the moment they'd left the house, he had been hoping to escape.

73
00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:47.714
Suddenly a man bumped into John, who lost his grip on Edward.

74
00:06:47.715 --> 00:06:52.331
Edward seized the opportunity and ran off.

75
00:06:52.332 --> 00:06:59.800
"If I find Tom at City Hall, pretending to be me, he'll spend the rest of his life in prison.

76
00:06:59.801 --> 00:07:05.946
I'll make sure of that!"

